    "text": "Identify correct <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in the reaction sequence given below :<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0111_c0584ffc300d.png\" style=\"width: 543px; height: 127px;\" />"
